BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: Toronto SUP, Kayak & Canoe
UID:event_314296962@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260503T040002Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260514T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260514T180000
SUMMARY:Kayak\, Canoe\, Stand-up Paddling Board on the scenic Humber River
 !
DESCRIPTION:Toronto SUP\, Kayak & Canoe Adventures - Meetup Group\n**Explo
 re the scenic Humber River in Toronto with our Kayak\, Canoe\, and stand-u
 p paddle board 2-hour rentals during the week!** Use the following link to
  book your spot:[ ](https://torontoadventures.ca/all-adventures/kayak-cano
 e-sup-rentals/)**[https://torontoadventures.ca/all-adventures/kayak-canoe-
 sup-rentals/](https://torontoadventures.ca/all-adventures/kayak-canoe-sup-
 rentals/)**[ ](https://torontoadventures.ca/all-adventures/kayak-canoe-sup
 -rentals/)\n\nThe calm meandering Humber River is one of Toronto’s hidde
 n gems! Home to a huge variety of wildlife\, including Beaver\, Blue Heron
 \, Deer and much more\, you’ll feel like you’ve left the city behind!\
 n\n*Events are subject to weather and other factors out of our control. If
  we must cancel or delay an event we will those booked on the [torontoadve
 ntures.ca](http://torontoadventures.ca/) website know as soon as possible.
 *\n\n**Pricing (per 2-hour rental)\, Payable online through:** [https://to
 rontoadventures.ca/all-adventures/kayak-canoe-sup-rentals/](https://toront
 oadventures.ca/all-adventures/kayak-canoe-sup-rentals/)\nSingle Kayak (sea
 ts 1 person) : $40 +taxes\nTandem Kayak (seats 2 people) : $70 +taxes\nReg
 ular Canoe (seats 2 people) : $60 +taxes\nLarge Canoe (seats 3 people) : $
 70 +taxes\nStand-up Paddle Board ( 1 person): $40 +taxes\n\n**Included:**\
 n\n* Boat(s)\, Paddle(s)\, PFD(s)/ “Life Jacket(s)”\, & Coast Guard Sa
 fety Kit.\n* Brief orientation covering paddling safety\, Toronto Adventur
 es’ rules\, and the Humber River paddling route\n* Our friendly staff to
  help you launch your boat(s) and/or boards.\n* SUP Leash (For Paddle Boar
 d Rentals Only)\n\n**What to bring?**\n\n* Dress for the weather!\n* Wear 
 closed-toe athletic footwear you don’t mind getting wet & muddy (shoes n
 ot required on SUPs).\n* Sunscreen\, sunglasses & hats\, are all recommend
 ed for sunny days.\n* A water bottle.\n* Government Issued Photo ID.\n\n**
 Important Information**\nAnyone under the age of 18 must have a Parent/Gua
 rdian/Adult accompany them all the times on the water. Online Adult Waiver
 s are available through confirmation emails. For minors\, waivers will nee
 d to be signed in person on location. There must be an Adult to Child rati
 o of 1:4 in the children are under 12 years of age. From ages 12-18 we req
 uire a 1:5 adult to youth ratio. We have lifejackets starting at 30 pounds
  and are fully adjustable.\n\n* Paddlers must be comfortable treading wate
 r while wearing a PFD and reaching a shoreline (minimum 20 metres to shore
 ).\n* Late Fees Returning Boat(s)/Equipment – $20/15 minutes per boat.\n
 \n**[Google Link Directions](https://torontoadventures.ca/directions/#humb
 erriverlocation)**\n**[Cancellation Policy](https://torontoadventures.ca/f
 aq/#cancellation)**\n\nWe hope to see you out on the water!
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/torontoadventurers/events/314296962/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260415T151726Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260415T151726Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
